# Default seed: recover Noor's next construction volume, then train Ivo into a new role.
find book/construction/7
expedition apartments-005 2 manual-1-construction-7=0.4
until last
books
study 3 construction
advance 20
save saves/skills-playthrough.json
load saves/skills-playthrough.json
until last
skills 3 construction
practice 3 construction
until last
skills 3 construction
find book/mechanical/2
expedition apartments-010 2 manual-2-mechanical-2=0.4
until last
books
skills 2 mechanical
study 2 mechanical
until last
practice 2 mechanical 3
until last
skills 2 mechanical
save saves/skills-playthrough-complete.json
report artifacts/skills/playthrough-report.json
quit
